    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "annot-zoho-sign-2b-s3-20260724",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 1960,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 190,
      "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Agreement persistence + webhooks live, 2B-S3): the inbound\n/api/{zoho,adobe}-sign/webhook onWebhook seams are now WIRED (server.ts) to handleZohoWebhook\n/ handleAdobeWebhook. New integrations/sign-agreements.ts is the store-backed reverse index\n(zoho_agreements + adobe_agreements, data/stores.ts) that the provider modules stay OUT of -\nit backs the recordAgreement + findAgreement seams, so zoho-sign.ts keeps its mongodb-free\nhermetic drive. TRUST MODEL: the public, credential-free webhook NEVER trusts the payload for\nsignature state - it re-fetches owner-scoped, fails closed on mismatch, and idempotently\nadvances the proposta to 'Assinada' exactly once (a replay is a no-op). Zoho is live; Adobe is\na fail-closed no-op on notConnectedBackend. Both agreement stores ride the ch10 migration passthrough.",
      "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Agreement persistence + webhooks live, 2B-S3): the inbound\n/api/{zoho,adobe}-sign/webhook onWebhook seams are now WIRED (server.ts) to handleZohoWebhook\n/ handleAdobeWebhook. New integrations/sign-agreements.ts is the store-backed reverse index\n(zoho_agreements + adobe_agreements, data/stores.ts) that the provider modules stay OUT of -\nit backs the recordAgreement + findAgreement seams, so zoho-sign.ts keeps its mongodb-free\nhermetic drive. TRUST MODEL: the public, credential-free webhook NEVER trusts the payload for\nsignature state - it re-fetches owner-scoped, fails closed on mismatch, and idempotently\nadvances the proposta to 'Assinada' exactly once (a replay is a no-op). Zoho is live; Adobe is\na fail-closed no-op on notConnectedBackend. Both agreement stores ride the ch10 migration passthrough.",
      "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-24 (Agreement persistence + webhooks live, 2B-S3): the inbound\n/api/{zoho,adobe}-sign/webhook onWebhook seams are now WIRED (server.ts) to handleZohoWebhook\n/ handleAdobeWebhook. New integrations/sign-agreements.ts is the store-backed reverse index\n(zoho_agreements + adobe_agreements, data/stores.ts) that the provider modules stay OUT of -\nit backs the recordAgreement + findAgreement seams, so zoho-sign.ts keeps its mongodb-free\nhermetic drive. TRUST MODEL: the public, credential-free webhook NEVER trusts the payload for\nsignature state - it re-fetches owner-scoped, fails closed on mismatch, and idempotently\nadvances the proposta to 'Assinada' exactly once (a replay is a no-op). Zoho is live; Adobe is\na fail-closed no-op on notConnectedBackend. Both agreement stores ride the ch10 migration passthrough.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#b45309",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
