    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "annot-wa-2a-s3-20260725",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 3197.5,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 175,
      "text": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-25 (WhatsApp inbound rail, 2A-S3): the Meta WhatsApp Cloud API webhook lands on the\nexisting ingress. NEW integrations/event-sources/whatsapp-hydrate.ts (sibling of email-hydrate.ts)\nholds the PURE extractWhatsAppMessages + the JSON-TEXT-parsing hydrateWhatsAppMessages + the\nwamid-SET dedup key. events/service.ts handleIngress now honours webhookConfig.secretSource.\n{credentialField} on the POST path via ONE resolveWebhookSecret shared with the GET-callback path:\nMeta signs with the app secret, so the OWNER credential - not the trigger secret - is what verifies;\nan unresolvable secret FAILS CLOSED (500, nothing enqueued, no secret in logs or responses).\ndispatch-input.ts gains buildArtifactBackendInputs (plural): a WhatsApp envelope FANS OUT to one\nMessageInput per message; ZERO inputs (statuses-only receipts) is a dispatched NO-OP. server.ts loops\nthe inputs at the composition root. Direction unchanged: events/ -> integrations/event-sources/.",
      "originalText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-25 (WhatsApp inbound rail, 2A-S3): the Meta WhatsApp Cloud API webhook lands on the\nexisting ingress. NEW integrations/event-sources/whatsapp-hydrate.ts (sibling of email-hydrate.ts)\nholds the PURE extractWhatsAppMessages + the JSON-TEXT-parsing hydrateWhatsAppMessages + the\nwamid-SET dedup key. events/service.ts handleIngress now honours webhookConfig.secretSource.\n{credentialField} on the POST path via ONE resolveWebhookSecret shared with the GET-callback path:\nMeta signs with the app secret, so the OWNER credential - not the trigger secret - is what verifies;\nan unresolvable secret FAILS CLOSED (500, nothing enqueued, no secret in logs or responses).\ndispatch-input.ts gains buildArtifactBackendInputs (plural): a WhatsApp envelope FANS OUT to one\nMessageInput per message; ZERO inputs (statuses-only receipts) is a dispatched NO-OP. server.ts loops\nthe inputs at the composition root. Direction unchanged: events/ -> integrations/event-sources/.",
      "rawText": "AS-BUILT 2026-07-25 (WhatsApp inbound rail, 2A-S3): the Meta WhatsApp Cloud API webhook lands on the\nexisting ingress. NEW integrations/event-sources/whatsapp-hydrate.ts (sibling of email-hydrate.ts)\nholds the PURE extractWhatsAppMessages + the JSON-TEXT-parsing hydrateWhatsAppMessages + the\nwamid-SET dedup key. events/service.ts handleIngress now honours webhookConfig.secretSource.\n{credentialField} on the POST path via ONE resolveWebhookSecret shared with the GET-callback path:\nMeta signs with the app secret, so the OWNER credential - not the trigger secret - is what verifies;\nan unresolvable secret FAILS CLOSED (500, nothing enqueued, no secret in logs or responses).\ndispatch-input.ts gains buildArtifactBackendInputs (plural): a WhatsApp envelope FANS OUT to one\nMessageInput per message; ZERO inputs (statuses-only receipts) is a dispatched NO-OP. server.ts loops\nthe inputs at the composition root. Direction unchanged: events/ -> integrations/event-sources/.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#b45309",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 918273645,
